に好かれている。母親とは違って学園の中で疎まれ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孤立している主人公にもクラスメイトの一人として他の"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生と同じように気軽に接してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまにおっちょこちょいな一面を見せることもあり、愛嬌のある性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93656"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20603","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20603","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20603","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20603","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e71dbb986c0b0f94edbba7b19af19f09b5a8909bd4e81c48ac81f61b14a8dcb6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf115f5f5693242475a31bb2e7043ceac6ee9c3336aea590915a2ebed4efddfe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"きみづか縁","creatorId":"vndb:s828","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s828","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s828","name":"きみづか 縁","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212671:93656:6036:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42111","characterName":"萩原 美久","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93659","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212671"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20604"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42111"},"originalCharacterName":"萩原 美久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"75"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is pure and innocent in her thinking and trusts people immediately if they are even slightly kind to her. She does not like to be treated like a child, but when she is told something difficult or theoretical, she says, \"I don't understand!\" She is also quick to sulk. She is very attached to her brother-in-law, Junichi, and spoils him when he is in sight."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42111"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段から主人公を目の敵にしている主任教師「萩原　純一」の義妹である下級生。マーチングバンド部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"調教対象である４人のうちの１人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく、無邪気で、 少しでも優しくされたりすると、すぐに人を 信用してしまう純粋な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義兄である純一を強く愛慕しており、人目の 無い所などでは甘えまくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20604","sourceWorkId":"27327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"思考が幼く、少しでも優しくされたりすると、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すぐに人を信用してしまう純粋無垢な性格、悪く言えば世間知らず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供扱いされることを嫌うが難解な事や理論的な事を言われると、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わかんない！」とすぐに拗ねたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義兄である純一を強く愛慕しており、人目の無い所などでは甘えまくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93659"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20604","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20604","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20604","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20604","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/086754ecdad576a53dc04a16600943a2fe48f1d9b0cf392406f12af6fbe24780.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43816a0566b6bce2f5ad1e8e473997e34363aad1e09d78cadc46d49b46514fc0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さくらなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s666","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s666","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s666","name":"岩泉まい(樋口まゆら、樋口まゆ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212671:93659:6279:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42113","characterName":"高柳 香織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93660","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212671"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20605"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42113"},"originalCharacterName":"高柳 香織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A well-known lady in the school, in addition to tea ceremony, she also enjoys flower arrangement and Japanese dance. Her family donates a large amount of money to the school, and the teachers look up to her. She and the student council president have a close family relationship, as their fathers have been close friends for a long time. Rumor has it that she is his fiance. Because of her natural aura of nobility, she is the \"big sister\" that her fellow underclassmen look up to."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42113"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは犬猿の仲である学生会長「明智　雅晴」の恋人とも婚約者とも噂される学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"調教対象である４人のうちの１人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"茶道部員。茶道の他に も華道や日本舞踊などもたしなむ、学園内で 知らない者のないお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれ持った高貴なオーラのせ いか、同性の下級生たちの「あこがれのお姉 様」的存在。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20605","sourceWorkId":"27327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"茶道の他に華道や日本舞踊などもたしなむ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内でも知らない者のないお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家が学園に多額の寄付をしており、教師たちからも一目おかれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生会長とは、お互いの父親が古くからの親友同士で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族同士で親交のある仲。噂では許嫁らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれ持った高貴なオーラのせいか、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同性の下級生たちの「あこがれのお姉様」的存在。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93660"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20605","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20605","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20605","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20605","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb55096f7fc09b9bec79003b3723434309ae587d3b1b333a9cad2e6079145fe1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a1b435e62f50ab7d2260dc9e5e4d9b08139d5740f77bddceaff976dd0ab53a5.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"竹間千ノ美","creatorId":"vndb:s574","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s574","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s574","name":"緒田 マリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212671:93660:19333:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42134","characterName":"若松 泉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93661","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212671"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20606"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42134"},"originalCharacterName":"若松 泉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an athletic, energetic and cheerful personality. She has a manly temperament, and her tone is masculine and rough. However, she gets angry when treated like a man. She is a well-known basketball player. She was admitted to the school as a special sports student, so her grades are not good. She is devoted to basketball and has no other hobbies. She seems to be close with her adviser, Hazuki, who has recently promoted her to ace of the team and has been coaching her one-on-one since then."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42134"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に必要以上に厳しい生活指導担当教師「宮下　葉月」が顧問を務めるバスケ部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"調教対象である4人のうちの1人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気のいいスポーツ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男勝りで、主人公に対して反抗的な態度をとる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"葉月からは贔屓されており、マンツーマンで指導を受けるなど、非常に親密な様子である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20606","sourceWorkId":"27327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"体育会系の元気で明るい性格。男勝りな気性で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調も男っぽく乱暴。だが、男扱いすると怒る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バスケットボールの世界では少し名の知られた選手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツ特待生として入学しているので成績は良くない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バスケ一筋で、他に趣味らしい物はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"顧問である葉月とは、最近チームのエースに昇格したため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以来マンツーマンで指導を受けたりと親密な仲のようである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93661"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20606","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20606","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20606","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20606","sourceWorkId":"27327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d37554f471bd866358e4d9255a0d46e9e79fe7d25b3d2822c3f81874e0026b69.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/66cac8e0829eb1fd3467ca47ccf855d6048e36882ea6cd35d328b440c2186830.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川瀬ゆう子","creatorId":"vndb:s647","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s647","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s647","name":"川瀬 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212671:93661:16174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42135","characterName":"堤 彩乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93662","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subj